<title>PORTUGAL: PORTUGUESE BONDS RECOVER, AWAIT INFLATION FIGURES.</title>
<headline>PORTUGUESE BONDS RECOVER, AWAIT INFLATION FIGURES.</headline>
<text>
<p>0930 GMT - Portuguese bonds recovered some ground ahead of the release of domestic and U.S. inflation figures for July.</p>
<p>*Sept 97 futures up 0.16 points at 110.16.</p>
<p>*Feb 07 cash 101.65 vs 101.48, yield 6.38 pct vs 6.40 pct</p>
<p>*Spread vs 10-yr cash Bund 71 bps vs 70 bps.</p>
</text>
